  "publisher": "Health New Zealand | Te Whatu Ora - Community Referred Radiology Programme",
  "description": "Atomic clinical indicators for the CT Chest, Abdomen and Pelvis (Adult) national referral criteria (National Community Referral Criteria for Imaging Part I, v2.0, published 09/04/2026, pp.10-11). This is the single extraction contract: the LLM extraction step, structured referral forms and the Criteria Viewer tick-list all produce a QuestionnaireResponse against this Questionnaire, which the CQL library CRR_CTChestAbdomenPelvis_Adult evaluates. Each answer may carry the answer-evidence extension (status documented|inferred, quote). Items that can be populated from coded patient-record data carry an SDC initialExpression naming a define in the population library CRR_CTCAP_Population (dormant until a retrieval tier is enabled); items without one are clinical judgements that always come from the referrer or the note.",
  "extension": [
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-library",
      "valueCanonical": "http://crr.health.nz/fhir/Library/CRR_CTChestAbdomenPelvis_Adult"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-library",
      "valueCanonical": "http://crr.health.nz/fhir/Library/CRR_CTCAP_Population"
    }
  ],
